cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use lpvid, please cite this repository and the accompanying resource record."
title: "lpvid: an RNA virus discovery and characterization workflow"
abstract: >-
  lpvid is a command-line workflow for RNA virus discovery and characterization
  from reads, contigs or protein inputs. It combines ORF prediction, reference
  prefiltering, RdRP identification, supergroup classification, phylogenetic
  placement and bilingual HTML reporting.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "NickShannn"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NickShannn/lpvid"
url: "https://github.com/NickShannn/lpvid"
license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "0.2"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
keywords:
  - RNA virus discovery
  - RdRP identification
  - metatranscriptomics
  - phylogenetic placement
  - bioinformatics workflow
